---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Matt Ehlinger | Software Engineer" description="Matt Ehlinger is a software engineer who helps teams build and ship excellent software." home>
	<div>
		<p class="max-w-[62ch]">
			<span class="underline decoration-wavy decoration-[#8445bb] dark:decoration-[#f3b2d4]">Staff Software Engineer</span> focused on helping teams build excellent software. I specialize in:
		</p>
		<br>
		<ul class="list-disc pl-6">
			<li>Transforming raw ideas into finished software.</li>
			<li>0 → 1 product development.</li>
			<li>Leveraging AI tools to increase velocity.</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="mt-5 max-w-[62ch]">
			Find me on <a href="https://github.com/veryspry" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mattehlinger/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>, or send me an email at <a href="mailto:matt@veryspry.com">matt@veryspry.com</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
	<section class="experience-section mt-10 max-w-[62ch] p-6 text-sm sm:max-w-[72ch]" aria-labelledby="experience">
		<h2 id="experience" class="text-[1.875rem] leading-[1.15] font-medium tracking-[-0.04em]">Experience</h2>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<div>
				<h3 class="italic">Staff Software Engineer</h3>
				<p><a href="https://gravitywiz.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gravity Wiz</a></p>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2">Owned new product development and technical leadership for engineering team.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<div>
				<h3 class="italic">Staff Software Engineer</h3>
				<p><a href="https://www.gatsbyjs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gatsby</a> (acquired by Netlify)</p>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2">Worked on Gatsby Cloud API's, infrastructure and integrations with third party CMS's.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<div>
				<h3 class="italic">Founder (technical)</h3>
				<p><a href="https://hellodeco.so/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hello Deco</a>&nbsp;(archived)</p>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2">Built product that turned Notion into a (nearly) complete email inbox.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<div>
				<h3 class="italic">Software Engineer</h3>
				<p><a href="https://wpengine.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WP Engine</a> / <a href="https://localwp.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LocalWP</a></p>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2">Owned addon development for LocalWP including API's, authentication systems, image compression and backup tools and component system.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<div>
				<h3 class="italic">Software Engineer</h3>
				<p>ISYS Technologies</p>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2">Built data visualization library that saved company 400K annually.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<div>
				<h3 class="italic">Junior Software Engineer</h3>
				<p><a href="https://groundbreaker.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Groundbreaker</a>&nbsp;(acquired by Janover)</p>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2">Built frontend, component library and APIs for a complete product rebuild.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.experience-section {
		--divider-color: #8e627b;
		border: 1px dashed var(--divider-color);
	}

	.experience-section h3::after {
		content: '';
		display: block;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 1px;
		margin: 0.4rem 0;
		background-color: #aaa5a7;
	}

	@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
		.experience-section {
			--divider-color: #bc8ca7;
		}

		.experience-section h3::after {
			background-color: #716b70;
		}
	}
</style>
